<title>NETHERLANDS: Uni-Invest sees higher result in 1996.</title>
<headline>Uni-Invest sees higher result in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property investment Fund Uni-Invest NV said on Tuesday it expected 1996 direct investment result per share of between 2.20-2.30 guilders.</p>
<p>Uni-Invest said this was far better than in 1995.  </p>
<p>Direct investment result was 1.88 guilders per share in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
